--- 9. what this record does NOT claim -----------------------------------------------
- No MPFS/MSS register behaviour, read-back or timing is claimed.
- No reset independence, reset scope or reset coverage is claimed; the model does not
  even represent F-4's reset-at-zero clause (C8/R21).
- No hardware or board fidelity is claimed.
- No clock, prescaler, timeout, cadence, margin, instance, window value, gating value
  or lock rule is claimed as a device or mission fact; the model's values are synthetic
  test parameters.
- No binding behaviour is claimed: HS-P1..HS-P8 (frozen, binding-scoped) remain NOT RUN;
  NC-1..NC-4 remain NOT RUN; MUT-1..MUT-6 are MODEL-LEVEL fixture-sensitivity evidence,
  not the frozen negative controls, and they do not show sensitivity to a defect in
  pal_watchdog.c (no production file is ever mutated).
- No emulator, target, HIL or board evidence is produced or implied.
- N18 is not re-run and remains FAIL; Lean is not re-run and remains PASS by retention.
- No NC is closed or reassigned (NC-EXT-205 stays OPEN); no gate, agenda item, parameter
  or design is approved; no requirement coverage delta is created; no commit or push.
- The model qualification is bound to the fixture digests in the phase manifest; any
  fixture change invalidates it and requires re-qualification. The fixture is NOT
  N10-qualified by this phase.

